'''Poké-Friends' Song''' (Japanese: '''ポケだちの{{tt|歌|うた}}''') is an ending theme of [[Meet Up at the Pokémon House?]]. It was released on the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G6Eh4djMATM official Japanese YouTube channel] on January 6, 2017.

